<title>PHILIPPINES: Waterfront says Q3 net at 30.087 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Waterfront says Q3 net at 30.087 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hotelier Waterfront Philippines Inc said on Wednesday that it posted a net income of 30.087 million pesos in the quarter ending September 30.</p>
<p>The company gave the figures in a statement to the Philippine Stock Exchange which contained no further details.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
